00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:29.612
&gt;&gt; MY LAPTOP WAS STILL THERE.

00:00:27.943 --> 00:00:30.413
YOU KNOW, UNGRADED PAPERS THAT

00:00:29.745 --> 00:00:32.915
WERE STILL THERE.

00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:34.817
&gt;&gt; FOR THE FIRST TIME SINCE 150

00:00:33.048 --> 00:00:35.818
BULLETS WERE FLYING DURING THE

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:39.722
VALENTINE'S DAY ATTACK, TEACHERS

00:00:35.951 --> 00:00:41.323
WERE ALLOWED TO RETURN TO

00:00:39.855 --> 00:00:41.957
STONEMAN DOUGLAS HIGH TO

00:00:41.457 --> 00:00:42.825
RETRIEVE PERSONAL ITEMS

00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:43.893
ABANDONED IN THE PANIC.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.094
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS HUGGING.

00:00:44.026 --> 00:00:45.594
THERE WAS HUGGING AND SOME

00:00:45.227 --> 00:00:46.996
TEARS.

00:00:45.728 --> 00:00:48.097
HANDSHAKES AND GLAD YOU'RE BACK.

00:00:47.129 --> 00:00:48.531
GLAD YOU'RE BACK.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.799
I DON'T KNOW.

00:00:48.664 --> 00:00:51.567
I HAD ENOUGH HUGS TO LAST ME,

00:00:49.932 --> 00:00:53.836
YOU KNOW, A LIFETIME TODAY.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.771
&gt;&gt; THIS AS DISBELIEF AND

00:00:53.969 --> 00:00:58.040
DISAPPOINTMENT RAGED NATIONWIDE

00:00:55.905 --> 00:01:00.075
AFTER THE REVELATION THAT AS THE

00:00:58.174 --> 00:01:01.677
SHOOTING WAS HAPPENING, THE HIGH

00:01:00.209 --> 00:01:03.913
SCHOOL'S RESOURCE OFFICER RAN TO

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:06.215
THE FRESHMAN BUILDING ARMED WITH

00:01:04.046 --> 00:01:08.651
A GUN BUT NEVER BARGED INSIDE.

00:01:06.348 --> 00:01:10.252
THAT OFFICER, SCOTT PETERSON, A

00:01:08.784 --> 00:01:11.854
30-YEAR VETERAN WHO WAS AWARDED

00:01:10.386 --> 00:01:13.722
BEST SCHOOL RESOURCE OFFICER

00:01:11.987 --> 00:01:17.059
FOUR YEARS AGO FOR HIS TACT AND

00:01:13.856 --> 00:01:18.360
GOOD JUDGMENT, ACCORDING TO

00:01:17.193 --> 00:01:20.729
BROWARD COUNTY SHERIFF, HE HAD

00:01:18.494 --> 00:01:21.430
NEITHER WHEN IT MATTERED THE

00:01:20.863 --> 00:01:22.631
MOST.

00:01:21.564 --> 00:01:23.566
&gt;&gt; WENT IN.

00:01:22.765 --> 00:01:25.201
ADDRESSED THE KILLER.

00:01:23.699 --> 00:01:27.136
KILLED THE KILLER.

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:28.537
&gt;&gt; ANOTHER MISSTEP AT THE SCENE,

00:01:27.269 --> 00:01:30.139
OFFICERS WHO THOUGHT THEY WERE

00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:32.241
WATCHING A LIVE FEED OF THE

00:01:30.272 --> 00:01:33.876
SHOOTER INSTEAD WERE WATCHING

00:01:32.374 --> 00:01:35.010
DELAYED SECURITY FOOTAGE.

00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:36.779
THE SHERIFF ALSO HAS SUSPENDED

00:01:35.144 --> 00:01:38.681
TWO OF HIS DEPUTIES WHO

00:01:36.912 --> 00:01:41.750
RESPONDED TO SOME OF THE 20 PLUS

00:01:38.814 --> 00:01:44.453
CALLS FOR SERVICE TO DEAL WITH A

00:01:41.884 --> 00:01:45.254
VOLATILE NIKOLAS CRUZ IN THE

00:01:44.587 --> 00:01:47.122
LAST FEW YEARS.

00:01:45.387 --> 00:01:48.057
ONE OF THE INSTANCES INVOLVES A

00:01:47.256 --> 00:01:48.991
CLAIM THAT HE PLANNED TO SHOOT

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.059
UP A SCHOOL.

00:01:49.124 --> 00:01:51.360
AND JUST MONTHS AGO --

00:01:50.192 --> 00:01:53.128
&gt;&gt; 911 EMERGENCY?

00:01:51.494 --> 00:01:55.397
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THE DISPATCHED CALLS

00:01:53.262 --> 00:01:56.165
MADE BY THE CONFESSED MASS

00:01:55.531 --> 00:01:58.501
KILLER HIMSELF.

00:01:56.298 --> 00:01:58.868
THIS TIME SUGGESTING HE WAS A

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.369
VICTIM.

00:02:00.503 --> 00:02:02.137
ON YOU?

00:02:00.836 --> 00:02:03.606
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:02:02.271 --> 00:02:05.074
THEY TRIED TO -- I KIND OF GOT

00:02:03.739 --> 00:02:05.641
MAD AND I STARTED PUNCHING WALLS

00:02:05.207 --> 00:02:07.743
AND STUFF.

00:02:05.774 --> 00:02:09.111
AND THEN A KID [BEEP] CAME AT ME

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:10.646
AND THREW ME ON THE GROUND.

00:02:09.245 --> 00:02:12.181
&gt;&gt; AND SOME OF THE FIRST

00:02:10.779 --> 00:02:13.482
RESPONDERS TO THE CHAOTIC SCENE

00:02:12.314 --> 00:02:15.017
LAST WEEK CAME FROM CORAL

00:02:13.616 --> 00:02:16.619
SPRINGS P.D.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.255
SPEAKING FOR THE FIRST TIME,

00:02:16.752 --> 00:02:20.155
OFFICER JEFF HEINRICH WHO WAS

00:02:19.388 --> 00:02:23.058
OFFDUTY AT THE TIME RUSHED IN AS

00:02:20.289 --> 00:02:25.160
A COP, AS A FATHER OF A STUDENT,

00:02:23.192 --> 00:02:26.028
AND HUSBAND OF THE SCHOOL'S

00:02:25.294 --> 00:02:27.763
ASSISTANT ATHLETIC DIRECTOR.

00:02:26.161 --> 00:02:30.933
&gt;&gt; BY THE GRACE OF GOD, WHEN I

00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:34.937
WALKED DOWN THE HIGHWAY, THEY

00:02:31.066 --> 00:02:35.938
FOUND EACH OTHER.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:39.041
THEY WERE ABLE TO SHELTER IN

00:02:36.071 --> 00:02:40.643
PLACE.

00:02:39.174 --> 00:02:42.144
&gt;&gt; AND FLORIDA REPUBLICAN

00:02:40.776 --> 00:02:44.280
GOVERNOR RICK SCOTT TODAY

00:02:42.278 --> 00:02:45.614
UNVEILING A HALF BILLION DOLLARS

00:02:44.413 --> 00:02:47.082
SCHOOL SAFETY PLAN.

00:02:45.748 --> 00:02:48.817
THREE POINT ACTION PLAN DEALING

00:02:47.216 --> 00:02:50.619
WITH MODIFYING GUN LAWS,

00:02:48.951 --> 00:02:52.221
IMPROVING HOW WE DEAL WITH

00:02:50.753 --> 00:02:53.656
MENTAL INSTABILITY AND ALSO

00:02:52.354 --> 00:02:55.925
ADDRESSING SCHOOL SAFETY, FOR

00:02:53.789 --> 00:02:57.960
EXAMPLE, MAKING SURE THERE IS AT

00:02:56.058 --> 00:02:59.028
LEAST ONE ARMED OFFICER FOR

00:02:58.093 --> 00:03:00.195
EVERY 1,000 STUDENTS AT EVERY

00:02:59.161 --> 00:03:02.197
SCHOOL IN THE STATE.

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:03.966
AS FOR THE STONEMAN DOUGLAS HIGH

00:03:02.331 --> 00:03:05.200
SCHOOL STUDENTS, THEY RETURN

00:03:04.099 --> 00:03:06.201
HERE ON WEDNESDAY OFFICIALLY

00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:09.538
GETTING BACK TO SCHOOL AND

00:03:06.335 --> 00:03:13.142
GETTING BACK TO THEIR CLASSROOMS

00:03:09.672 --> 00:03:15.244
TO FINISH OFF THIS NOW FOREVER

